 "source_instruction": "i m looking for a 8 no. vinyl acetate man's sandals",
 "query": "I swear the community garden plot I\u2019ve been tending to all spring is out to test every last bit of my patience this week. I showed up yesterday morning to find that a family of mischievous raccoons had dug up half my young cucumber starts, knocked over the rain barrel I spent three hours assembling last weekend, and dragged my favorite faded canvas gardening gloves all the way to the edge of the adjacent wooded lot. I spent nearly two hours patching up the soil, re-staking the tomato cages they\u2019d trampled, and rigging up a silly little motion-activated sprinkler to keep them from coming back, only to realize on my walk home that I\u2019d stepped right in a patch of spiky thistle that poked clean through the worn-out flip-flops I\u2019d thrown on that morning.\nHey, I\u2019m looking through the men\u2019s sandals section right now and need a pair that\u2019s made with vinyl chloride, comes in a size 8, and has a built-in bottle opener attached to the strap. I don\u2019t want to spend too much, so can you show me options that fit what I\u2019m asking for? I\u2019ve been scrolling for ages and keep seeing pairs that miss the mark on what I need, so it\u2019d be great to narrow this down quick.",
